<tr><th>Rectangle</th><td>4 right angles</td><td>Study examples/nonexamples, circle matching source shapes and justify</td></tr>
<tr><th>Rhombus</th><td>4 equal sides</td><td>Study examples/nonexamples, circle matching source shapes and justify</td></tr>
